## Where to go next

- `vignette("getting-started")`: a first query and what it returns.
- `vignette("filtering")`: how place, date and storm filters combine.
- `vignette("linkage")`: joining precipitation and flood records to storms
  without double counting.
- `vignette("plotting")`: exposure, count and track maps.
- `vignette("versions-and-caching")`: manifests, dataset versions and the
  download cache.
- [Data sources](https://sparklabnyc.github.io/gtropic/articles/data-sources.html)
  and the [plot gallery](https://sparklabnyc.github.io/gtropic/articles/plot-gallery.html)
